        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 15, 6 Inch Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 6\" Center to Center (CTC)  door pull is made from 3/4\" diameter solid round bar stock. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store doors. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-15_size.gif?v=1704354671\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 15 Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/5-1-2-inch-door-pull-3-4-inch-diameter-don-jo-14\"><b>5-1/2\" Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/8-inch-door-pull-3-4-inch-diameter-don-jo-16\"><b>8\" Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/10-inch-door-pull-3-4-inch-diameter-don-jo-17\"><b>10\" Door Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMade of 4 different materials in 5 finish choices:<br>\r\n*Solid Aluminum: Clear Anodized Aluminum finish.<br>\r\n*Solid Brass: Polished Brass finish.<br>\r\n*Solid Bronze: Oil Rubbed Bronze finish.<br>\r\n*Solid Stainless Steel: Polished Stainless Steel or Satin Stainless Steel finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the  Don-Jo 15, Commercial 6\" Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Bar Stock</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/15.pdf?v=1704262238\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 15 Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
